## Command

```shell
biome format --write file.grit
```

## `biome.json`

```json
{
  "formatter": { "lineWidth": 120 },
  "grit": { "formatter": { "lineWidth": 40 } }
}
```

## `file.grit`

```grit
language js

`foo($x)` where {
	$x <: `1`,
	register_diagnostic(span=$x, message="mm")
}

```

